{"id": "z1133", "pool": "know-openbook", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The correct answer is D, which is spot s on a ladybug. These are inherited characteristics because they are physical traits that are passed down from the parents to their offspring through genetic material. Mice being able to navigate a maze or learning to sit on command are examples of learned behaviors rather than inherent traits. Do lphins doing tricks for their trainers are also learned behaviors and not inherent characteristics.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
